    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline starts with the Global Policy Architect generating a complete initial draft. Next, the Labor & Culture Compliance Critic reviews it for legal, cultural, and operational flaws across all 12 markets. The Cross-Border Policy Refiner then incorporates that feedback into a revised policy. The Operational Stress-Test Gate evaluates the revised document for real-world viability; if material issues remain, it loops back to the Refiner for further improvement (up to 3 iterations). Once the gate passes, the Executive Policy Polisher formats and finalizes the policy for leadership presentation."
